    "termsOfUse": "Re-use of data is limited to academic research in the field of grief/bereavement. The data will only be shared with researchers affiliated with universities or independent, non-commercial research institutes. Permission for re-use can be granted by the ethics board of the Faculty of Behavioral and Social Sciences, University of Groningen only. The contact point with the ethics board is the Groningen Digital Competence Centre through the email dcc@rug.nl",
    "termsOfAccess": "The data contains sensitive information about the subjects and is therefore restricted from openly sharing it. Requests can only be made by researchers affiliated with universities or independent, non-commercial research institutes. In addition, a confidentiality agreement, stating that the data will not be shared with persons who are not collaborators on the project the data is used for, must be signed. ",
